WEBVTT

00:05:59.313 --> 00:06:03.192
Imagine colors, textures, sounds, images,

00:06:03.192 --> 00:06:05.152
anything that gives you sensory pleasure.

00:06:05.986 --> 00:06:08.823
Sometimes I like to imagine
cherry blossoms

00:06:08.823 --> 00:06:11.283
softly floating down from trees.

00:06:11.283 --> 00:06:16.330
Or I use a fiery pinkish orange
or a relaxing blue as a backdrop

00:06:16.372 --> 00:06:18.207
for the experience that I'm imagining.

00:06:19.208 --> 00:06:20.835
Next, try places.

00:06:20.876 --> 00:06:23.379
And keep in mind that setting
will be more important

00:06:23.421 --> 00:06:25.047
to some of us than to others.

00:06:25.089 --> 00:06:26.465
Reach back into your memory

00:06:26.507 --> 00:06:29.260
to that secluded beach
you visited many years ago.

00:06:29.301 --> 00:06:33.514
Or create a setting from scratch
with as much privacy and comfort,